{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_bdrk_3tifjpeelqqzlhuu746gom52jd7ti7fz7o7kzera5cgbmfegycqq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_bdrk_0147C2paHBNkWE725Lm9p4e2","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"fileKey":"FmzIScI8szSoayMiaXLpGx","description":"Read all text on Start Here and Foundations pages","code":"const out=[];\nfor (const id of ['0:1','1:2']) {\n const p = await figma.getNodeByIdAsync(id); await figma.setCurrentPageAsync(p);\n out.push('=== '+p.name);\n const walk=(n,d)=>{ let s='  '.repeat(d)+n.type+' '+n.id+' \"'+n.name+'\" '+(n.width?Math.round(n.width)+'x'+Math.round(n.height):'');\n  if(n.type==='TEXT') s+=' :: '+n.characters.replace(/\\n/g,' | ');\n  if(n.fills&&n.fills.length&&n.fills[0].type==='SOLID'&&n.type!=='TEXT'){const c=n.fills[0].color;s+=' fill#'+[c.r,c.g,c.b].map(v=>Math.round(v*255).toString(16).padStart(2,'0')).join('');}\n  out.push(s); if(n.children&&d<6) n.children.forEach(c=>walk(c,d+1));};\n p.children.forEach(c=>walk(c,0));\n}\nreturn out.join('\\n');"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":26,"cache_creation_input_tokens":969,"cache_read_input_tokens":7911,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":969,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"54dd8af1-8b1e-46fd-811b-61b252afbc7e","uuid":"0fa7070a-bf16-4eaa-9891-7be0ee6e06f5","timestamp":"2026-10-31T22:11:44.879Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"toolu_bdrk_0147C2paHBNkWE725Lm9p4e2","display_name":"Use Figma","server_display_name":"figma-authenticated-proxy","tool_name":"use_figma"}]}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_bdrk_0147C2paHBNkWE725Lm9p4e2","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"=== 00 · Start Here 设计任务\nFRAME 7:2 \"Start Here · Brief\" 1440x3155 fill#ffffff\n  FRAME 7:3 \"Header\" 1312x145\n    TEXT 7:4 \"LEVEL L2 · DESIGN TASK · v2\" 182x19 :: LEVEL L2 · DESIGN TASK · v2\n    TEXT 7:5 \"Expenio — personal expense manager\" 1312x52 :: Expenio — personal expense manager\n    TEXT 7:6 \"Design Expenio, a personal expense manager: get started, check your balance and spending, open your wallet, add a new card, pay a friend and keep the receipt. Canvas 375 × 812, iPhone, light mode. Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference.\" 1312x50 :: Design Expenio, a personal expense manager: get started, check your balance and spending, open your wallet, add a new card, pay a friend and keep the receipt. Canvas 375 × 812, iPhone, light mode. Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference.\n  FRAME 7:7 \"How to work\" 1312x227\n    TEXT 7:8 \"How to work\" 147x35 :: How to work\n    TEXT 7:9 \"1. Build exactly the 6 frames below, named exactly as listed (one state per frame), and wire them as a clickable prototype with the listed links. 2. Everything in “Must include” must appear on that frame. The lists are grouped by subject and sorted alphabetically — they are not in screen order and say nothing about layout, grouping, emphasis or styling. Those are your decisions. 3. The brand color and the typeface in 01 · Foundations are fixed. Define every other color yourself, plus type scale, spacing, radii and elevation, and apply them consistently. 4. 02 · Components gives only a default Button, a default Text Field and the platform shell (status bar, home indicator). Design all other states, the headers, the navigation and every business component as reusable components in your file. 5. Use the logo, illustrations, card artwork, avatars, merchant and card-network marks and icons from 04 · Media. 6. Copy and data must match “Fixed data” exactly. This brief wins over anything you may know of the original kit.\" 1312x176 :: 1. Build exactly the 6 frames below, named exactly as listed (one state per frame), and wire them as a clickable prototype with the listed links. | 2. Everything in “Must include” must appear on that frame. The lists are grouped by subject and sorted alphabetically — they are not in screen order and say nothing about layout, grouping, emphasis or styling. Those are your decisions. | 3. The brand color and the typeface in 01 · Foundations are fixed. Define every other color yourself, plus type scale, spacing, radii and elevation, and apply them consistently. | 4. 02 · Components gives only a default Button, a default Text Field and the platform shell (status bar, home indicator). Design all other states, the headers, the navigation and every business component as reusable components in your file. | 5. Use the logo, illustrations, card artwork, avatars, merchant and card-network marks and icons from 04 · Media. | 6. Copy and data must match “Fixed data” exactly. This brief wins over anything you may know of the original kit.\n  FRAME 7:10 \"Frames · goals · must include · links\" 1312x1145\n    TEXT 7:11 \"Frames · goals · must include · links\" 413x35 :: Frames · goals · must include · links\n    TEXT 7:12 \"Frame names are fixed. Must-include lists are grouped by subject and sorted A–Z: they state what is on the screen, never where it goes or how it looks.\" 1312x22 :: Frame names are fixed. Must-include lists are grouped by subject and sorted A–Z: they state what is on the screen, never where it goes or how it looks.\n    FRAME 7:13 \"Frame cards\" 1312x1056\n      FRAME 7:14 \"01_Get_Started\" 644x296 fill#f7f7fa\n        TEXT 7:15 \"01_Get_Started\" 136x26 :: 01_Get_Started\n        TEXT 7:16 \"Goal: Understand what Expenio is and start.\" 596x20 :: Goal: Understand what Expenio is and start.\n        