{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_bdrk_35cd4kepsc3h6fdgvell3xrufxex7kgk47n4pmzsppzu27wmsqxa","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I've built all six Expenio screens in 03 · Workspace, plus a library of reusable components, and wired the clickable prototype. I took screenshots of every screen and fixed what looked wrong. All 11 links read back correctly. I didn't click through the prototype in presentation mode.\n\nI signed in as zuohaosheng@tetras.ai, as required. The reference pages (00, 01, 02, 04) were not changed.\n\n**File:** https://www.figma.com/design/FmzIScI8szSoayMiaXLpGx/\n**03 · Workspace page ID:** `8:2`\n\n**Screens** (375 × 812, light mode):\n\n| Frame | ID | What's on it |\n|---|---|---|\n| 01_Get_Started | `19:105` | Expenio logo, the Get Started illustration, the brief's copy, Get Started button |\n| 02_Home | `19:125` | Maria's avatar, \"Hello, Maria\", \"Home\", new payment (+) button; My Balance $25,520.00 with a chevron; Expenses chart MAR–AUG with JUN highlighted at $80.40; \"Wallet\" with \"See all\" and 3 transactions (debits in dark text, the +$50.00 credit in green) |\n| 03_Wallet | `19:213` | Back, \"Wallet\", add card button; Maria's Visa card in front with two other cards behind it and a \"Card 1 of 3\" indicator; POPULAR cashback promo; \"Transactions\" with 3 rows |\n| 04_Add_Card | `22:373` | A sheet over 03_Wallet (the wallet header shows, dimmed, above it). Card preview shows the Mastercard number; name and expiry are not entered yet. Card number field is focused (blue border and cursor) with the Mastercard logo; the other fields are empty with their placeholders; CVV has the help icon |\n| 05_Payment | `22:492` | \"Payment\"; PAYING Robert Dawson with his avatar; $50.00; Maria's Visa card, card 1 of 3; empty \"Add a note\" field; Cancel and Pay now |\n| 06_Receipt | `22:542` | \"Receipt\" with share button; CASH RECEIPT 20.08.2020; Amount $40.00, Service Fee $2.82, Internet Charge $7.18, Total $50.00; barcode; Home button |\n\nAll copy and amounts match the brief's fixed data. Media comes from 04 · Media, and every screen has the status bar and home indicator from 02 · Components.\n\n**Prototype** (starts at 01_Get_Started, flow named \"Expenio · main flow\"):\n- Get Started → 02\n- On 02: the balance card and \"See all\" → 03; the + button → 05\n- On 03: Back → 02; add card → 04 (slides up as a sheet)\n- On 04: close and \"Add new card\" → 03 (sheet slides down)\n- On 05: Pay now → 06; Cancel → 02\n- On 06: Home → 02\n\n**Components:** these sit in the \"Expenio · Components\" frame (`11:2`) below the screens, with a note listing the colors, type sizes, spacing, corner radii and shadows I chose:\n- **Buttons and fields:** the primary buttons on the screens are the button from 02 · Components. Pressed and disabled states and a secondary style (used for Cancel) are separate variants. The field states (default, focused, filled, error, disabled) are built on the 02 · Components text field and have an optional icon on the right.\n- **Shared pieces:** icon button, avatar, merchant logo tile, card position indicator, chart point (normal and highlighted), section header, transaction row and nav bar.\n- **Business components:** payment card (Maria's Visa as current or inactive, two other wallet cards, the new-card preview), balance card, expenses chart, promo card, payee, receipt line, receipt card, home header and bottom sheet.\n\n**Limitations:**\n- Pressed and disabled states exist as component variants but aren't triggered by interactions in the prototype.\n- Transaction rows, chart points, the promo, the other wallet cards, share and note entry have no links, as the brief specifies.\n- On 05_Payment I added a small \"Amount\" label above $50.00, which isn't in the brief's copy.\n- The dimmed wallet behind the sheet on 04 is a copy of 03's layers, so it won't update if you change 03."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":26,"cache_creation_input_tokens":955,"cache_read_input_tokens":123733,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":955,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"54dd8af1-8b1e-46fd-811b-61b252afbc7e","uuid":"3acead14-6cd4-4830-b4c5-2d6f96713908","timestamp":"2026-10-31T22:31:35.259Z"}
